  "description": "Directional cover tiers (MEC-04), on the combat hit chance itself. An M113's .50 cal at 300 m has 39% against a T-80BV in the open. Light cover (x0.7): inside forest 27%, behind a wreck between target and shooter 27%; a wreck behind the target (wrong side) gives none, 39%. Heavy cover (x0.4): inside a standing building 15%. Infantry in a crater at 100 m: 6% in the open, 4% in the crater. Fire from an aircraft ignores light cover: an A-10's GAU-8 (600 m ground range) has the same 58% against a tank in forest as in the open.",
